PASS no passthrough: the child's own rule (40)
PASS class from the parent: its scoped rule beats the child's own (120)
PASS class hole: c1 (60)
PASS class:on off: the child's own style:height stays (20)
PASS style: from the parent on the root (90)
PASS a passed style: beats the root's own style:height (25)
PASS a keyed {#each} of components passing a class
--- exit 0
